  "notes": "FORMS:\n{反発|はんぱつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ - to oppose, to resist; to repel, to rebound\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {反発|はんぱつ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{招|まね}く→招く：02425_maneku⟧ - to invite opposition\n- {反発|はんぱつ}{力|りょく} - repulsive force; resilience\n- {高|たか}{反発|はんぱつ} - high resilience (mattresses, golf clubs)\n- {低|てい}{反発|はんぱつ} - low resilience (memory foam)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n⟦{反感|はんかん}→反感：08675_hankan⟧ is a feeling of dislike, while {反発|はんぱつ} involves active opposition or resistance.",
